Found while fixing skeid #35: Proxy.pm _proxy_openai_stream accumulates $accumulated_content_bytes and never reads it; both stream translators expose content_bytes via ->usage, which no caller in lib/ uses (only their POD). The POD claims it is "the fallback when an upstream never reports token counts", but no usage event falls back to it. Decide: wire it into the usage event as the documented fallback (a new field? ADR 0004 usage-event contract), or delete the counter and the third usage() return value. Counting is UTF-8 bytes since #35.

